思想 ルール 倫理 関係ない
Beliefs, rules, ethics—they don't matter!

509
00:42:53,677 --> 00:42:56,677
アメイジングハッピーハロウィンナイト
Amazing Happy Halloween Night!

510
00:42:57,677 --> 00:43:02,177
「私はロボットではありません」に
On the "I am not a robot" prompt,

511
00:43:02,177 --> 00:43:06,177
無心でチェックし回答するけれど
I mindlessly check the box and answer,

512
00:43:06,177 --> 00:43:08,177
本当にそうかな
but is that really true?

513
00:43:08,177 --> 00:43:10,677
Happy Life! とりま音に乗せて
Happy Life! For now, ride the beat.

514
00:43:10,677 --> 00:43:13,477
Happy Life! デタラメに踊るの
Happy Life! Dance randomly.

515
00:43:13,477 --> 00:43:15,877
Happy Life! その繰り返しのなか
Happy Life! In that endless cycle,

516
00:43:15,877 --> 00:43:18,177
懐疑心も失った
I even lost my skepticism.

517
00:43:18,177 --> 00:43:21,477
意志のない様まるで
Lacking any will, just like...

518
00:43:21,477 --> 00:43:25,177
ロボトミーした電気羊
...a lobotomized electric sheep.

519
00:43:25,177 --> 00:43:29,177
ナイトメア NPC
A nightmare, an NPC...

520
00:43:29,177 --> 00:43:33,677
だけどなんか心地がいい
But somehow, it feels quite nice.

521
00:43:33,677 --> 00:43:34,877
What?

522
00:43:34,877 --> 00:43:37,677
おっと音声が乱れました
Oops, the audio got distorted.

523
00:43:37,677 --> 00:43:40,177
お気になさらずに皆々様
Don't let it bother you, everyone.

524
00:43:40,177 --> 00:43:42,677
そんなお口は縫い合わせて
Let's sew up those mouths of yours.

525
00:43:42,677 --> 00:43:45,477
アメイジングハッピーハロウィンナイト
Amazing Happy Halloween Night!

526
00:43:45,477 --> 00:43:47,977
良い子の口にはチョコとキャンディ
In the mouths of good kids go chocolate and candy.

527
00:43:47,977 --> 00:43:50,477
歯に衣着せてっちゃ噛み合わない
Mincing words won't get us anywhere.

528
00:43:50,477 --> 00:43:52,977
気を取り直しみんなでどうぞ
Pull yourselves together and join in, everyone!

529
00:43:52,977 --> 00:43:55,677
アメイジングハッピーハロウィンナイト
Amazing Happy Halloween Night!

530
00:44:06,177 --> 00:44:08,477
知っちゃった！知っちゃった！
I found out! I found out!

531
00:44:08,477 --> 00:44:11,177
知っちゃった！知っちゃった！
I found out! I found out!

532
00:44:11,177 --> 00:44:17,477
知っちゃった！知っちゃった！
I found out! I found out!

533
00:44:17,477 --> 00:44:22,177
全部全部理解した
I understood everything.

534
00:44:22,177 --> 00:44:25,177
だから何も見たくねぇわ
That's why I don't want to see a single thing!

535
00:44:25,177 --> 00:44:27,677
さぁ始まった夢の夜だ
Now it has begun, the night of dreams!

536
00:44:27,677 --> 00:44:30,177
音楽が響いて鳴り止まない
The music echoes and won't stop playing.

537
00:44:30,177 --> 00:44:32,677
声を揃えて叫べ今日は
Shout in unison, for today is...

538
00:44:32,677 --> 00:44:35,477
アメイジングハッピーハロウィンナイト
Amazing Happy Halloween Night!

539
00:44:35,477 --> 00:44:37,977
ジャック いたずら 無礼講だ
Jack-o'-lanterns, tricks, let's let loose!

540
00:44:37,977 --> 00:44:40,477
真面目に生きても割に合わない
Living seriously isn't worth the effort.

541
00:45:12,918 --> 00:45:16,118
トリック・オア・トリート！
Trick or treat!

542
00:45:17,418 --> 00:45:19,318
お菓子をくれても
Even if you give me sweets,

543
00:45:19,318 --> 00:45:22,118
イタズラはしちゃうよ！
I'll still play a trick on you!

544
00:45:50,418 --> 00:45:53,618
ようこそ everyone 身の毛もよだつこの spooky night
Welcome, everyone, to this hair-raising spooky night!

545
00:45:53,618 --> 00:45:55,718
腹の底まで痺れ
Numb down to the bottom of your stomach...

546
00:45:55,718 --> 00:45:57,418
kick & bass & hats & trumpet

547
00:45:57,418 --> 00:46:00,418
ランタンと swingin' beat 赤い紐で踊り狂えば
With the lantern and a swingin' beat, if we dance madly with red ribbons,

548
00:46:00,418 --> 00:46:04,418
浮世の憂いも忘れられるでしょ
you'll surely forget the worries of this fleeting world, right?

549
00:46:04,418 --> 00:46:07,618
近頃巷じゃ お化けよりも怖い人たち
Lately around town, there are people scarier than ghosts,

550
00:46:07,618 --> 00:46:11,618
増えすぎちゃってすぐに 1out, 2out, 3out, KO!!
who've multiplied too much and immediately: 1 out, 2 out, 3 out, KO!!

551
00:46:11,618 --> 00:46:15,118
コンプライアンスも 厳しい世の中ですが
Although compliance is strict in this world nowadays,

552
00:46:15,118 --> 00:46:18,318
恐怖のリライト 請け負います
we'll take charge of rewriting your fears.

553
00:46:18,318 --> 00:46:20,118
GIVE ME A CHERRY PIE

554
00:46:20,118 --> 00:46:21,618
それとも may I choke you up?
or may I choke you up?

555
00:46:21,618 --> 00:46:23,618
GIVE ME A FLOWY DRESS

556
00:46:23,618 --> 00:46:25,618
それとも may I stab you to death?
or may I stab you to death?

557
00:46:25,618 --> 00:46:27,318
poison, rope, cake and tea

558
00:46:27,318 --> 00:46:29,118
knife, scissors, R.I.P.

559
00:46:29,118 --> 00:46:32,918
choose one... choose one... choose one...

560
00:46:34,818 --> 00:46:35,818
「さぁ選んで」
"Now, choose."

561
00:46:35,818 --> 00:46:36,618
なんちゃって
Just kidding!

562
00:46:36,618 --> 00:46:40,318
ドッキリ大成功 響くパンパカパンファンファーレで
The prank was a big success! With the resounding fanfare...

563
00:46:40,318 --> 00:46:42,918
にっこり笑っちゃってはいピース
smile brightly and say cheese!

564
00:46:42,918 --> 00:46:45,118
あー怖かったななんて
Saying "Ah, that was so scary,"

565
00:46:45,118 --> 00:46:47,418
座り込んで涙目で
sitting down with teary eyes,

566
00:46:47,418 --> 00:46:50,118
笑う顔見たいな
I want to see your laughing face!

567
00:46:50,118 --> 00:46:54,118
ちっちゃな箱の中の モンスターに怯えるくらいなら
If you're going to be frightened by a monster inside a tiny box,

568
00:46:54,118 --> 00:46:56,918
いつだってここにおいで
you can always come here!

569
00:46:56,918 --> 00:47:00,918
もっとずっと本能的で楽しくなれる
You can become much more instinctively happy!

570
00:47:00,918 --> 00:47:04,418
恐怖と踊っちゃおうぜ
Let's dance with fear!

571
00:47:04,418 --> 00:47:07,618
騒々相転移でキマってカタルシス
A chaotic phase transition triggers catharsis!

572
00:47:07,618 --> 00:47:11,118
もういっちょ 感情ジェットコースターで ゴキゲンデトックス
One more time, a mood detox on an emotional roller coaster!

573
00:47:26,118 --> 00:47:29,618
満月が暴く醜悪な本性
The full moon reveals our ugly true nature,

574
00:47:29,618 --> 00:47:33,118
デタラメに杖振り回し hocus pocus
waving our wands randomly, hocus pocus!

575
00:47:33,118 --> 00:47:36,618
劣等感を苗床に育つ呪いを
The curse grown in the seedbed of inferiority complexes,

576
00:47:36,618 --> 00:47:40,118
摘み取る術を知ってるかい？
do you know the way to pluck it out?

577
00:47:40,118 --> 00:47:42,918
「迷える哀れな子羊たちよ」
"O pitiful, lost lambs,"

578
00:47:42,918 --> 00:47:44,418
「お菓子が欲しいかい？」
"do you want sweets?"

579
00:47:44,418 --> 00:47:45,918
「それとも安らぎが欲しいかい？」
"Or do you want peace?"

580
00:47:45,918 --> 00:47:47,118
「永遠に求め続けるの？」
"Will you keep seeking forever?"

581
00:47:47,118 --> 00:47:48,618
「それならば、ずっと苦しいままだ」
"Then, you will remain suffering forever."

582
00:47:48,618 --> 00:47:50,318
「恐怖からの解放によって」
"If there is salvation that can be achieved"

583
00:47:50,318 --> 00:47:52,118
「成し得る救済があるのならば」
"through liberation from fear,"

584
00:47:52,118 --> 00:47:54,418
「この目隠しはそのままで」
"then leave this blindfold on."

585
00:47:54,418 --> 00:47:56,118
「さぁ、」
"Now,"

586
00:47:56,118 --> 00:47:59,118
「イタズラ完了」
"trick complete."

587
00:47:59,118 --> 00:48:02,418
永遠に断ち切れない 呪いの鎖に囚われ
Trapped in a chain of curses that can never be broken,

588
00:48:02,418 --> 00:48:06,618
朽ち果ててしまう前に
before you completely rot away...

589
00:48:06,618 --> 00:48:10,118
脳みそちょっと弄るだけであら不思議！
Just a little tinkering with your brain, and oh, wonder!

590
00:48:10,118 --> 00:48:13,118
こんなに気持ち良くて
It feels so good...

591
00:48:13,118 --> 00:48:15,618
気分爽快
and refreshing!

592
00:48:18,618 --> 00:48:20,118
なんちゃって
Just kidding!

593
00:48:20,118 --> 00:48:22,618
ドッキリ大成功 響くパンパカパンファンファーレで
The prank was a big success! With the resounding fanfare...

594
00:48:22,618 --> 00:48:25,618
にっこり笑っちゃってはいポーズ
smile brightly and pose!

595
00:48:25,618 --> 00:48:27,618
あー幸せだったななんて
Saying "Ah, I was so happy,"

596
00:48:27,618 --> 00:48:30,118
へたり込んで涙目で
slumping down with teary eyes,

597
00:48:30,118 --> 00:48:33,118
笑う顔っていいな
a laughing face is so wonderful!

598
00:48:33,118 --> 00:48:36,618
もう苦しまなくていいよ こんなに頑張ったんだから
You don't have to suffer anymore, since you've worked so hard!

599
00:48:36,618 --> 00:48:40,118
躊躇わずこっちにおいで
Come over here without hesitation!

600
00:48:40,118 --> 00:48:43,618
もうずっと本能的に気持ちいいだけの
To a goal that is just instinctively pleasurable,

601
00:48:43,618 --> 00:48:47,418
ゴールを見せてあげる
I'll show you the goal!

602
00:48:47,418 --> 00:48:50,618
困難極まってこそ光るカタルシス
Catharsis shines brightest when difficulties reach their peak!

603
00:48:50,618 --> 00:48:54,618
もういっちょ 因果全リセットで タマシイデトックス
One more time, a soul detox with a complete reset of causality!

604
00:49:04,118 --> 00:49:08,618
いつかの、あったかもしれない世界の出来事までをも、
Even the events of some world that might have existed once...

605
00:49:08,618 --> 00:49:13,118
この冥界ではこうして思念として漂っているんだね。
...are floating here in this Underworld as thoughts.

606
00:49:13,118 --> 00:49:16,118
あまり深入りしてはいけないよ。
You shouldn't delve too deep into them.

607
00:49:16,118 --> 00:49:19,618
こういうのが一番たちが悪い。
Things like this are the most troublesome.

608
00:49:19,618 --> 00:49:23,618
私はただ、あなたを愛していただけ。
I was only... loving you.

609
00:49:31,718 --> 00:49:38,318
物言わぬ唇に生気を吹き込んで
Breathing life into those silent lips,

610
00:49:38,318 --> 00:49:42,318
今宵「あなた」は蘇る
tonight, "you" shall return to life...

611
00:49:42,318 --> 00:49:46,318
あの頃の姿で。
...in your form from back then.

612
00:50:11,626 --> 00:50:13,426
白肌の娘が咳をした。
The pale-skinned girl coughed.

613
00:50:13,426 --> 00:50:16,126
「この身貴方に捧げるわ」
"I offer this body to you."

614
00:50:16,126 --> 00:50:17,926
白服の医者が囁いた。
The doctor in white whispered,

615
00:50:17,926 --> 00:50:20,226
「迎えに行くよ」
"I'll come for you."

616
00:50:20,226 --> 00:50:22,326
白肌の娘は朽ち果てた。
The pale-skinned girl decayed,

617
00:50:22,326 --> 00:50:24,426
世界の誰にも見捨てられ、
abandoned by everyone in the world.

618
00:50:24,426 --> 00:50:26,426
白服の医者は哀れんで、
The doctor in white took pity on her,

619
00:50:26,426 --> 00:50:29,026
誰も知らない居場所で眠らせた。
and laid her to rest in a place no one knew.

620
00:50:29,026 --> 00:50:31,726
朽ちてもまだ
Though decayed, she was still

621
00:50:31,726 --> 00:50:34,726
美しい顔で、
so beautiful.

622
00:50:34,726 --> 00:50:37,726
ふたりしかいない霊廟で、
In the mausoleum with only the two of them,

623
00:50:37,726 --> 00:50:40,626
医者は恋をした。
the doctor fell in love.

624
00:50:40,626 --> 00:50:43,426
それは永遠の恋か。
Was it eternal love...

625
00:50:43,426 --> 00:50:46,726
禁断の行為か。
...or a forbidden act?

626
00:50:46,726 --> 00:50:49,726
また逢いたいと願うだけ。
I only wished to see her again.

627
00:50:49,726 --> 00:50:52,726
それが罪なのでしょうか。
Could that truly be a sin?

628
00:50:52,726 --> 00:50:55,426
物言わぬ唇に
Into those silent lips...

629
00:50:55,426 --> 00:50:58,426
生気を吹き込んで、
...breathing the breath of life,

630
00:50:58,426 --> 00:51:01,426
今宵ふたりは結ばれる。
tonight, the two shall be joined...

631
00:51:01,426 --> 00:51:04,426
祝福もされずに。
...without a single blessing.

632
00:51:16,126 --> 00:51:18,926
「腐り堕ちた眼窩に青い硝子を」
"Blue glass into the decayed eye sockets..."

633
00:51:18,926 --> 00:51:21,726
「破れかけた腕に絹の肌を」
"Silk skin upon the torn arms..."

634
00:51:21,726 --> 00:51:24,526
「侵された内臓に綿のガーゼを」
"Cotton gauze inside the diseased organs..."

635
00:51:24,526 --> 00:51:27,326
「宝石で飾った純白いドレスを」
"A pure white dress adorned with jewels..."

636
00:51:27,326 --> 00:51:30,926
朽ちゆくたび取り繕って、
Repairing her as she continued to decay,

637
00:51:30,926 --> 00:51:33,926
恋を謳って、また医者は
singing of love, once more the doctor

638
00:51:33,926 --> 00:51:39,426
手を染め続けた。
continued to stain his hands.

639
00:52:02,926 --> 00:52:05,426
やがて暴かれたのは
Eventually, what was exposed...

640
00:52:05,426 --> 00:52:08,426
醜い怪物で、
...was an ugly monster.

641
00:52:08,426 --> 00:52:10,426
「それ」を造り上げた医者は、
The doctor who created "it"...

642
00:52:10,426 --> 00:52:14,426
弁駁を叫んだ。
...screamed his defense.

643
00:52:15,426 --> 00:52:17,426
「これは永遠の恋だ。
"This is eternal love!

644
00:52:17,426 --> 00:52:21,426
彼女の願望だ。
It was her desire!

645
00:52:21,426 --> 00:52:23,926
死にゆくと決めたお前らが
You all decided she was to die...

646
00:52:23,926 --> 00:52:27,926
見棄てた女じゃないか」
...isn't she the woman you abandoned?"

647
00:52:27,926 --> 00:52:30,426
鳴呼……哀しき花嫁。
Ah... the tragic bride,

648
00:52:30,426 --> 00:52:33,726
物言えぬままで、
still unable to speak a word.

649
00:52:33,726 --> 00:52:36,726
今宵ふたりは裁かれる。
Tonight, the two will be judged...

650
00:52:36,726 --> 00:52:42,426
彼女を見棄てた人達の正義で。
...by the justice of those who abandoned her.

651
00:52:42,426 --> 00:52:47,426
正しいのはだあれ？
Who is truly in the right?

652
00:53:24,926 --> 00:53:27,926
さて、ハロウィンパーティーもついにフィナーレ！
Now, the Halloween party is finally reaching its finale!

653
00:53:27,926 --> 00:53:34,126
ここで、ご参加くださった国民の皆様へ冥界からのお土産品のご紹介です！
And now, here is a showcase of souvenirs from the underworld for all of our citizens who participated!

654
00:53:34,126 --> 00:53:37,126
お土産品は全４種類。
There are four types of souvenirs in total.

655
00:53:37,126 --> 00:53:44,126
フルセットでご購入いただいた皆様には特典もございます。ご一緒に詳しく見ていきましょう！
For those who purchase the full set, there is also a special bonus. Let's take a closer look together!

656
00:53:44,126 --> 00:53:50,726
まず1つ目、今回の冥界ハロウィンナイトをイメージしたワイドラバーマットです！
First up, the wide rubber mat inspired by this underworld Halloween night!

657
00:53:50,726 --> 00:53:55,426
国王様の横には、冥界の女王の姿が。名を「ナイラ」というそうです。
Next to the king, we see the Queen of the Underworld. Her name is said to be Nyra.

658
00:53:55,426 --> 00:54:02,726
冥界のハロウィンを存分に楽しんでほしいという気持ちを込めた、彼女のイメージソングも、
With the hope that you will fully enjoy the underworld's Halloween, her image song...

659
00:54:02,726 --> 00:54:07,926
この後お披露目予定ですのでお楽しみに！
...is also scheduled to be revealed after this, so please look forward to it!

660
00:54:07,926 --> 00:54:12,726
素敵なイラストは、Matcha様にかいていただきました！
The wonderful illustration was drawn by Matcha-sama!

661
00:54:12,726 --> 00:54:16,926
2つ目は、パスポート風王国シール帳です！
Second is the passport-style kingdom sticker book!

662
00:54:16,926 --> 00:54:22,326
このシール帳には、これからたくさんの思い出を記していきたいですね。
We hope to fill this sticker book with many memories to come.

663
00:54:22,326 --> 00:54:27,326
王国の軌跡として、国民の皆様も今後集めてみてはいかがでしょうか？
As a record of the kingdom's journey, how about starting your collection, everyone?

664
00:54:27,326 --> 00:54:33,926
その一歩として、今回のキービジュアルのステッカーを1枚封入しております！
As a first step, we've included one sticker of this key visual!

665
00:54:33,926 --> 00:54:38,926
3つ目は、SUKONBU FACTORYよりキングフブちゃんぬいぐるみです！
Third, from SUKONBU FACTORY, the King Fubu-chan plushie!

666
00:54:38,926 --> 00:54:45,426
こちらは国王自らデザインをしており、とても愛らしいぬいぐるみとなっております。
This one was designed by the king herself, making it a very adorable plushie.

667
00:54:45,426 --> 00:54:51,426
前回のボリューム1のぬいぐるみをお持ちの方は、ご一緒に飾ってあげてくださいね！
If you have the plushie from Volume 1, please display them together!

668
00:54:51,426 --> 00:54:55,726
4つ目は、王国リボンチャームです！
Fourth is the kingdom ribbon charm!

669
00:54:55,726 --> 00:55:00,926
こちらは秘書である私の胸元のリボンが再現されております。
This is a reproduction of the ribbon worn on my chest as your secretary.

670
00:55:01,614 --> 00:55:02,514
るもよし
...is also fine,

671
00:55:02,514 --> 00:55:04,414
ペンライトにつけるもよしと
or attaching it to a penlight,

672
00:55:04,414 --> 00:55:07,314
多機能なリボンチャームとなっておりますので
as this is a multi-functional ribbon charm.

673
00:55:07,314 --> 00:55:12,514
皆様の「おし活」とやらに、ぜひご活用ください
Please do make use of it for your so-called "Oshikatsu"!

674
00:55:13,314 --> 00:55:15,114
最後は特典のお知らせです
Finally, here is the notice about the purchase bonus.

675
00:55:15,114 --> 00:55:20,514
フルセットご購入の方全員に チェキ風ブロマイドカードを1つお付けいたします
Everyone who purchases the full set will receive a cheki-style bromide card.

676
00:55:20,514 --> 00:55:25,114
複製サインと国王からのメッセージもあるそうですよ
It apparently includes a printed signature and a message from the King.

677
00:55:25,114 --> 00:55:30,614
数量限定バージョンは直筆サイン入りですので 皆様お早めに！
The limited edition version includes a hand-written signature, so hurry up!

678
00:55:31,614 --> 00:55:35,014
以上、今回のお土産品紹介でした！
That's all for this merchandise presentation!

679
00:55:35,614 --> 00:55:36,614
さて
Well then,

680
00:55:36,614 --> 00:55:39,814
この後は冥界の女王様をイメージした楽曲
up next is the song inspired by the Queen of the Underworld,

681
00:55:39,814 --> 00:55:42,914
『冥界Halloween Night!』のお披露目です！
the premiere of "Underworld Halloween Night!"!

682
00:55:42,914 --> 00:55:44,914
楽しまれた後は
After you've enjoyed it,

683
00:55:44,914 --> 00:55:48,014
無事、王国へお帰りくださいね保存
make sure you return safely to the kingdom.

684
00:55:48,014 --> 00:55:49,914
それでは！
With that, let's begin!

685
00:56:05,614 --> 00:56:07,114
Welcome! さあ、踊ろうよ
Welcome! Come, let's dance

686
00:56:07,114 --> 00:56:09,014
This is Halloween Night!

687
00:56:22,114 --> 00:56:25,114
冥界を挙げての Party (Party)
A party with the entire Underworld (Party)

688
00:56:25,114 --> 00:56:28,114
ルール違反はダメです Warning (Warning)
Violating rules is forbidden, Warning (Warning)

689
00:56:28,114 --> 00:56:31,314
説明は一度きり (きり)
Explanation is only given once (once)

690
00:56:31,314 --> 00:56:33,514
聞き逃せばあの世行き！
Miss it and you're off to the next world!

691
00:56:33,514 --> 00:56:35,014
冗談です♡
Just kidding♡

692
00:56:35,014 --> 00:56:36,514
(いち！) お菓子を回して
(One!) Pass around the candy

693
00:56:36,514 --> 00:56:38,114
(に！) 仮装して盛って！
(Two!) Dress up and look grand!

694
00:56:38,114 --> 00:56:41,014
(さん！) 生者か死者かは隠す事！
(Three!) Hide whether you are living or dead!

695
00:56:41,014 --> 00:56:42,514
(それ！)
(Go!)

696
00:56:42,514 --> 00:56:44,014
(よん！) いつだって笑顔で
(Four!) Always keep a smile

697
00:56:44,014 --> 00:56:45,514
(ご！) 油断禁物です！
(Five!) Do not let your guard down!

698
00:56:45,514 --> 00:56:48,614
最後の最後は無事にご帰宅の事
At the very end, make sure to return home safely

699
00:56:48,614 --> 00:56:51,614
独りきりじゃ つまらないわ
Being all alone is so boring

700
00:56:51,614 --> 00:56:54,614
この退屈な お城の玉座
In this boring castle's throne room

701
00:56:54,614 --> 00:56:59,014
指折りずっと 待ちわびてた
Counting the days, I've been waiting anxiously

702
00:56:59,014 --> 00:57:01,614
人恋しいとか？
Am I lonely?

703
00:57:01,614 --> 00:57:02,614
ヤダ！
No way!

704
00:57:02,614 --> 00:57:04,114
そんなんじゃないってば！
It's not like that at all!

705
00:57:04,114 --> 00:57:06,114
Let's 冥界 Halloween Night!
Let's Underworld Halloween Night!

706
00:57:06,114 --> 00:57:09,014
Dancing! Dancing! 闇夜にハッピーなメロディー
Dancing! Dancing! A happy melody in the dark night

707
00:57:09,014 --> 00:57:12,114
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 冥界 Halloween Night!
Rat-tat-tat Rat-tat-tat Underworld Halloween Night!

708
00:57:12,114 --> 00:57:15,214
Swinging! Swinging! ゾッとして愉快なアイロニー
Swinging! Swinging! A thrilling and delightful irony

709
00:57:15,214 --> 00:57:18,614
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 狂宴のショータイム！
Rat-tat-tat Rat-tat-tat, showtime of the mad feast!

710
00:57:18,614 --> 00:57:20,114
(Pa Pa Pa) 恐ろしや
(Pa Pa Pa) How terrifying

711
00:57:20,114 --> 00:57:21,614
(Pa Pa Pa) 恨めしや
(Pa Pa Pa) How resentful

712
00:57:21,614 --> 00:57:25,114
昔々 憂いさえも忘れてる
Long ago, even grief has been forgotten

713
00:57:25,114 --> 00:57:26,014
あらら？
Oh my?

714
00:57:26,014 --> 00:57:27,414
(Pa Pa Pa) 美味しそうな
(Pa Pa Pa) Delicious looking

715
00:57:27,414 --> 00:57:28,814
(Pa Pa Pa) 魂だわ！
(Pa Pa Pa) souls!

716
00:57:28,814 --> 00:57:30,614
Welcome! さあ、踊ろうよ
Welcome! Come, let's dance

717
00:57:30,614 --> 00:57:32,514
This is Halloween Night!

718
00:57:44,614 --> 00:57:47,614
響く楽団の Tuning (Tuning)
The orchestra's tuning echoes (Tuning)

719
00:57:47,614 --> 00:57:50,614
その不協和音さえも Music (Music)
Even that dissonance is Music (Music)

720
00:57:50,614 --> 00:57:53,814
王室のドアが開き (開き)
The royal doors open wide (open)

721
00:57:53,814 --> 00:57:56,814
拍手喝采が起こる
Thunderous applause breaks out

722
00:57:56,814 --> 00:57:58,114
快感です♡
It feels so good♡

723
00:57:58,114 --> 00:57:59,614
(いち！) ロウソクを灯して
(One!) Light up the candles

724
00:57:59,614 --> 00:58:01,114
(に！) ドレス纏って！
(Two!) Wear your dress!

725
00:58:01,114 --> 00:58:04,114
(さん！) 女王の私の お出ましです！
(Three!) The appearance of me, the Queen!

726
00:58:04,114 --> 00:58:05,614
(さあさあ！)
(Come, come!)

727
00:58:05,614 --> 00:58:07,114
(よん！) 手を取り合って
(Four!) Take each other's hands

728
00:58:07,114 --> 00:58:08,614
(ご！) 今日は無礼講で！
(Five!) Tonight there are no formalities!

729
00:58:08,614 --> 00:58:11,614
私に魅せられちゃったら 最期です
If you are captivated by me, it is the end

730
00:58:11,614 --> 00:58:14,614
鮮やかなステップ くるり舞ってワルツ
With brilliant steps, twirling to a Waltz

731
00:58:14,614 --> 00:58:17,614
百鬼夜行のリズムに揺られて保存
Swayed by the rhythm of the Night Parade

732
00:58:17,614 --> 00:58:21,614
この楽しさ 癖になるわ
This fun is becoming addictive

733
00:58:21,614 --> 00:58:24,114
時間切れとか？
Is time running out?

734
00:58:24,114 --> 00:58:25,114
ヤダ！
No way!

735
00:58:25,114 --> 00:58:26,614
全然足りないってば！
It's not nearly enough!

736
00:58:26,614 --> 00:58:28,614
Let's 冥界 Halloween Night!
Let's Underworld Halloween Night!

737
00:58:28,614 --> 00:58:31,614
Dancing! Dancing! 一夜の奇っ怪なメモリー
Dancing! Dancing! A bizarre memory of one night

738
00:58:31,614 --> 00:58:34,614
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 冥界 Halloween Night!
Rat-tat-tat Rat-tat-tat Underworld Halloween Night!

739
00:58:34,614 --> 00:58:37,614
Sweety! Sweety! おもむろに頬張るキャンディー
Sweety! Sweety! Slowly stuffing candy in my cheeks

740
00:58:37,614 --> 00:58:41,614
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ ああ、もっと頂戴！
Rat-tat-tat Rat-tat-tat, oh, give me more!

741
00:58:42,114 --> 00:58:48,414
うたかたの夢 淡い霧の中溶けて
A fleeting dream, melting into the pale mist

742
00:58:48,414 --> 00:58:54,614
蒼白い頬を 涙が伝った
Tears streamed down the pale cheeks

743
00:58:54,614 --> 00:59:01,214
この歌は誰の為？ 自問自答の末
For whom is this song? After questioning myself

744
00:59:01,214 --> 00:59:05,614
禁断の箱を開けたら
Once I open the forbidden box,

745
00:59:05,614 --> 00:59:10,114
時間を戻す 魔法使っちゃおっかな！
maybe I should use magic to turn back time!

746
00:59:13,714 --> 00:59:16,814
Dancing! Dancing! 闇夜にハッピーなメロディー
Dancing! Dancing! A happy melody in the dark night

747
00:59:16,814 --> 00:59:20,014
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 冥界 Halloween Night!
Rat-tat-tat Rat-tat-tat Underworld Halloween Night!

748
00:59:20,014 --> 00:59:23,114
Swinging! Swinging! ゾッとして愉快なアイロニー
Swinging! Swinging! A thrilling and delightful irony

749
00:59:23,114 --> 00:59:26,614
ラッタッタ ラッタッタ 狂宴のショータイム！
Rat-tat-tat Rat-tat-tat, showtime of the mad feast!

750
00:59:26,614 --> 00:59:28,114
(Pa Pa Pa) おそろしや
(Pa Pa Pa) How terrifying

751
00:59:28,114 --> 00:59:29,614
(Pa Pa Pa) うらめしや
(Pa Pa Pa) How resentful

752
00:59:29,614 --> 00:59:32,614
昔々 憂いさえも忘れてる
Long ago, even grief has been forgotten

753
00:59:32,614 --> 00:59:33,614
あらら？
Oh my?

754
00:59:33,614 --> 00:59:34,814
(Pa Pa Pa) おいしそうな
(Pa Pa Pa) Delicious looking

755
00:59:34,814 --> 00:59:36,514
(Pa Pa Pa) たましいだわ！
(Pa Pa Pa) souls!

756
00:59:36,514 --> 00:59:38,414
Welcome! さあ、踊ろうよ
Welcome! Come, let's dance

757
00:59:38,414 --> 00:59:40,614
This is Halloween Night!

758
01:00:02,195 --> 01:00:04,695
ハロウィンパーティー、いかがでしたでしょうか？
How did you enjoy the Halloween party?

759
01:00:05,195 --> 01:00:08,695
ちゃんとこちら側の王国に戻ってこられていますか？
Have you managed to return safely to our kingdom?

760
01:00:09,195 --> 01:00:16,195
冥界の女王様に気に入られてしまうと、魂を奪われてしまって、帰ってこられませんからね。
If the Queen of the Underworld takes a liking to you, she'll steal your soul and you won't be able to return.

761
01:00:16,695 --> 01:00:21,195
戻ってこられて、ラッキーでした！なんて、ふふっ。
You were lucky to make it back! Just kidding, hehe.

762
01:00:22,195 --> 01:00:26,195
あ、今日のお話はどうでしたか？楽しかったでしょうか？
Oh, how did you like today's stories? Were they fun?

763
01:00:26,695 --> 01:00:29,995
私が特にお気に入りは、探偵のお話でして...
My personal favorite was the detective story...

764
01:00:30,195 --> 01:00:33,595
今回お聞かせできて、とても嬉しかったです。
I was so happy to be able to share it with you this time.

765
01:00:33,995 --> 01:00:37,695
そうだ、いつかあなたのお話も聞かせてくださいね。
Oh, right! Please tell me your story someday, too.

766
01:00:38,195 --> 01:00:43,695
もしかすると、あの本に、あなたのお話も書き記されるかもしれませんよ。
Who knows, your story might even be written down in that book.

767
01:00:44,395 --> 01:00:48,595
何と言っても、摩訶不思議な本ですから。
After all, it is a very mysterious book.

768
01:00:48,695 --> 01:00:53,195
何が起こるか、司書である私にもわかりません。
Even as the librarian, I have no idea what might happen next.

769
01:00:54,195 --> 01:00:56,995
さて、そろそろお時間ですね。
Well, it is almost time.

770
01:00:57,195 --> 01:01:00,195
またお話が聞きたくなりましたら、
If you ever wish to hear another story,

771
01:01:00,195 --> 01:01:04,195
いつでもこの、王国図書館へお越しください。
you are welcome to visit this Kingdom Library anytime.

772
01:01:04,395 --> 01:01:07,195
それでは、さようなら。
And so, farewell.

773
01:01:18,695 --> 01:01:26,695
ハジマリはきっと ひとつの願い それを抱いて私たちは 生まれた
The beginning is surely a single wish, and embracing it, we were born...

774
01:01:26,695 --> 01:01:32,195
孤独な夜空 震える指先で 天と天を繋げよう
In the lonely night sky, with trembling fingertips, let's connect the heavens together!

775
01:01:41,695 --> 01:01:44,195
すこん部の皆さん 準備はできてますか？
Everyone in Sukonbu, are you ready?

776
01:01:44,695 --> 01:01:47,195
セイ・ホー・レッツ・ゴー いきますよ！
Say ho, let's go! Here we go!

777
01:01:47,195 --> 01:01:52,695
セイ！ ほら 俯いた顔を上げて みんなで手を取れば、ほら！
Say! Look up from your downcast face, if everyone takes each other's hands, look!

778
01:01:53,195 --> 01:01:55,695
はい！ まだまだ道は途中
Yes! We're still on our way,

779
01:01:55,695 --> 01:01:58,195
世界を越えよう
let's go beyond the world!

780
01:01:58,195 --> 01:02:01,195
セイ！ ほら 押し押しが我儘
Say! Look, my support is selfish,

781
01:02:01,195 --> 01:02:04,195
止まらない 全力ですから
and unstoppable because I'm giving it my all!

782
01:02:04,195 --> 01:02:07,195
夢を描き終えたら
Once we've finished drawing our dreams,

783
01:02:07,195 --> 01:02:10,195
追いかけ続けよう
let's keep chasing after them!

784
01:02:10,195 --> 01:02:12,695
共に 鳴る ファンファーレ ゴー！
Let the fanfare ring out together, go!

785
01:02:18,695 --> 01:02:23,195
だから気が付いた 自分自身の 輝きを見失ったときには
So when you realize you've lost sight of your own shine,

786
01:02:26,195 --> 01:02:31,695
思い出してね 僕らの星座は 君がいるから輝く
please remember that our constellation shines because you are here.

787
01:02:42,695 --> 01:02:45,195
無数の星の中
Among countless stars,

788
01:02:45,195 --> 01:02:47,195
光を君がくれた
you gave me light.

789
01:02:47,195 --> 01:02:49,695
もっと 越えて行けるさ
We can go even further!

790
01:02:49,695 --> 01:02:52,695
スーパーノヴァを起こせ今
Cause a supernova right now!

791
01:02:52,695 --> 01:02:55,695
何度だって飛べる
We can fly as many times as it takes!

792
01:02:55,695 --> 01:02:58,195
これは 紛れもなく 僕らの軌跡
This is, without a doubt, our miracle!

793
01:02:58,195 --> 01:03:01,195
ハイファイン！
Hi-Fine!

794
01:03:11,695 --> 01:03:14,695
ラストメッセージ！すこん部ーー！
Last message! Sukonbu!

